Add API cpu_has_msgint() and replace kvm_cpu_has_msgint() with the new
API, also check CPU msgint feature with API cpu_has_msgint() rather than
OnOffAuto type variable CPULoongArchState::msgint.

There is problem if msgint is set as ON_OFF_AUTO_AUTO in KVM mode, QEMU
will check host feature and set its real value in cpucfg1, which is used
by API cpu_has_msgint(), however field msgint is still ON_OFF_AUTO_AUTO.

